class NEXUSRAGGraph:
  LangGraph StateGraph with 6 nodes + conditional edges.
  
  RAGState (TypedDict):
    query: str
    query_type: str          ← factual/analytical/comparative
    expanded_queries: List[str]
    retrieved_docs: List[Document]
    reranked_docs: List[Document]
    generated_answer: str
    citations: List[Citation]
    ragas_scores: Dict[str, float]
    healing_attempts: int
    is_faithful: bool
    final_answer: str
    pipeline_trace: List[str]
    
  6 Nodes (ALL FULLY IMPLEMENTED):
  
  router_node:
    Input: query
    Classify query: factual / analytical / comparative / conversational
    Set retrieval strategy based on type
    Tools: classify_query, detect_language, extract_entities
    
  retriever_node:
    Input: query + query_type + expanded_queries
    Run hybrid retrieval (BM25 + pgvector HNSW)
    Run HyDE + multi-query expansion
    Collect top-20 candidates
    Tools: hybrid_search, bm25_search, dense_search
    
  reranker_node:
    Input: retrieved_docs + query
    CrossEncoder reranking → top 10
    ColBERT late interaction → top 5
    Filter by relevance threshold
    Tools: crossencoder_rerank, colbert_rerank
    
  generator_node:
    Input: reranked_docs + query
    Build context-aware prompt
    Call AWS Bedrock Claude-3-Sonnet
    Extract citations with page/chunk references
    Tools: build_prompt, call_bedrock, extract_citations
    
  evaluator_node:
    Input: answer + query + context_docs
    Compute RAGAS: faithfulness, answer_relevancy,
                   context_precision, context_recall
    If faithfulness < 0.7 → trigger healer
    Tools: compute_ragas, check_hallucination
    
  healer_node:
    Input: low-score answer + original query
    Strategies (in order):
      1. Query reformulation (rephrase)
      2. Expand retrieval (k*2)
      3. Switch retrieval mode (dense-only)
      4. Use different prompt template
    max healing_attempts = 3
    Tools: reformulate_query, expand_retrieval, switch_strategy
    
  Conditional Edges:
    router → retriever (always)
    retriever → reranker (if docs found)
    retriever → healer (if no docs found)
    reranker → generator (always)
    generator → evaluator (always)
    evaluator → END (if scores OK)
    evaluator → healer (if scores low)
    healer → retriever (retry with new query)
    healer → END (if max attempts reached)

